{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2023-03-02 10:00:00', 'title': 'BOEING NOMINATES SABRINA SOUSSAN TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': "ARLINGTON, VA. , MARCH 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --THE BOEING COMPANY [NYSE: BA] BOARD OF DIRECTORS TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS NOMINATED SABRINA SOUSSAN TO BE ELECTED AS A NEW DIRECTOR AT THE COMPANY'S UPCOMING ANNUAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS."}